
# 🌟 ECEPJ Neuron Model & Neurobyte Concept

The **ECEPJ neuron model** proposes that neurons act as biological capacitors — they store, modulate, and release graded energy rather than just firing simple on/off spikes. This perspective helps us understand brain function as a dynamic, energetic system rather than a binary machine.

## 💡 The Neurobyte

The **Neurobyte** is a new, multidimensional coding unit in this model. It carries information using:
- **Amplitude** (signal strength)
- **Frequency** (rhythm and oscillation)
- **Shape** (unique waveform)
- **Neurotransmitter signatures** (dopamine, serotonin, glutamate, GABA, and more)

This sophisticated code represents a true energetic language of the brain, going beyond traditional spike-based models.

